AiReadingOut.description:
ARGUS AI's reading of the incident (D-324): text only, it never changes the queue. ``story``:
what happened, the strongest case against it, one incident or two, what to check next;
``second_opinion``: a P1's second opinion from a larger model.

UnverifiedOut.description:
ELK sign-in only: ARGUS cannot confirm the person's access in ELK right now. In an
``outage`` (the SIEM was unreachable) reading and reviewing go on, but nothing reaches Kibana;
after ARGUS's own ``refused`` (its limits) reading only.
